## 8. Reference

The canonical specification for all traceability rules is
**`docs/stc.md`** (the Single Traceability Contract). Consult it for:

- Complete ontology and node type definitions (STC §1)
- Allowed trace graph edges and forbidden edges (STC §2)
- Tag format regex patterns and canonical examples (STC §3)
- Registry schemas and lifecycle rules (STC §4, §5)
- Full invariant table (STC §6)
- CI/tooling integration and enforcement hooks (STC §7)

**This rule file enforces a strict subset of the STC.** If any conflict exists
between this file and the STC, the STC takes precedence.
